Z||000006||tgowens||06-11-2000||12:31 AM||||Well, Phaeton, tomorrow is the 2nd Annual Poker Run of the Golden Gate Fieros -- I will be taking my digital camera and taking quite a few pics for the web site and I am sure a shot or two of the "New and Improved George I. Miller '88GT" will show up here -- or, I might just throw in a link to the site so you can see everybody's cars!! -- I'm sure there will be close ups of the Metallic Green, hood scoops, and new wheels (not to mention the wood grain dash) on George's car -- stay tuned!!||||reg||1
